<section class="twm-library__hero" aria-labelledby="twm-heading-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="twm-library__hero-copy">
    <p class="twm-library__kicker">Typewriters.com reference desk</p>
    <h2 id="twm-heading-{{ section.id }}">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
    <div class="twm-library__intro">{{ section.settings.intro }}</div>

    <a class="twm-library__button twm-library__button--dark" href="#manual-library-{{ section.id }}">
      Search the manual shelf
      <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="twm-library__finder-note">
    <span class="twm-library__finder-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
    <div>
      <h3>Start with the machine label</h3>
      <p>Look on the back, underside, or inside the ribbon cover. Copy the complete model name and any series number.</p>
    </div>
    <span class="twm-library__finder-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
    <div>
      <h3>Match before downloading</h3>
      <p>Wheelwriter series and similarly named electronic models can use different controls. Confirm the full model shown on the card.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<nav class="twm-library__jump" aria-label="Manual page shortcuts">
  <a href="#manual-library-{{ section.id }}">Find a manual</a>
  <a href="#twm-identify-{{ section.id }}">Identify your model</a>
  <a href="#twm-support-{{ section.id }}">Ask for help</a>
</nav>

<details id="twm-identify-{{ section.id }}" class="twm-library__identify">
  <summary>
    <span>
      <small>Not sure what you own?</small>
      How to identify a typewriter model
    </span>
    <span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
  </summary>
  <div class="twm-library__identify-body">
    <div>
      <strong>Check these locations</strong>
      <p>Inspect the underside, rear panel, area beneath the ribbon cover, and the label near the power cord.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <strong>Record the full wording</strong>
      <p>Include Personal, Series II, or other suffixes. Those words can distinguish machines that use different manuals.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <strong>Still uncertain?</strong>
      <p>Send a clear photo of the machine and label to <a href="mailto:{{ section.settings.email | escape }}">{{ section.settings.email | escape }}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</details>